d 'VALIDEMAIL': module to email validation via Regex, DNS/MX Check, and Disposable Domain Detection
d
d  Eric A. Booth, eric.a.booth@gmail.com validemail provides a
d multi-stage validation for email address variables. It performs
d Regex format checks, Disposable email detection, and DNS/MX
d record verification. 
d
d KW: email; data validation; data cleaning; DNS
d
d Requires: Stata version 16.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f validemail.ado
f validemail.sthlp
